# 詞: 銀包

1. 我個銀包入面只有一百蚊，唔夠坐地鐵。 (My wallet only has a hundred dollars in it, which isn't enough for the subway.)
2. 你個銀包點解會喺度？我唔記得自己放咗入邊。 (Where is your wallet? I don't remember where I put it.)
3. 個銀包好靚，係真皮嘅，價錢仲唔錯。 (The wallet is beautiful, made of genuine leather, and the price is reasonable.)
4. 我每個月俾錢俾銀行，都要用個銀包入面張銀行卡。 (I use the card in my wallet to pay my bills at the bank every month.)
5. 個銀包入面有幾張卡同幾張紙鈔，好亂。 (There are several cards and some paper money in the wallet, it's a mess.)
6. 我唔使帶銀包，手機入面有支付程式，掃碼就夠。 (I don't need to bring my wallet; I have a payment app on my phone, just scan the code.)
7. 個銀包入面有一張學生證，我仲要帶去學校。 (There's a student ID card in the wallet, I still need to bring it to school.)
8. 個銀包入面有一張銀行卡，我仲要帶去銀行。 (There's a bank card in the wallet, I still need to bring it to the bank.)
9. 個銀包入面有一張銀行卡，我仲要帶去銀行。 (There's a bank card in the wallet, I still need to bring it to the bank.)
10. 個銀包入面有一張銀行卡，我仲要帶去銀行。 (There's a bank card in the wallet, I still need to bring it to the bank.)

完成10句例句 [end of text]


